1. Magic cancellation helps prevent stoning attacks.  The primary
source of MC is cloaks.  Without a cloak, you have no MC.  MC3 (e.g.
from an elven/oilskin cloak, cloak of invisibility/protection/magic
resistance, apron, or robe--probably missing some) would stop this
stoning attack 98% of the time.
2. Were you burdened?  Normally you get at least one turn after you
feel yourself slowing down to eat a lizard corpse or whatever (and note
that simply carrying a lizard corpse in main inventory prevents some
kinds of stoning from a cockatrice).
3. More likely, did you get the messages mixed up?  If "You bite the
cockatrice" instead of vice-versa, you die immediately.  Dragons don't
wear muzzles to protect them from such mistakes.   That is one everyone
has to learn once, and it can be tough to remember if, say, you
polymorph into a vampire...



